{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>You, and your son, and your daughter.</b> These are minors. Or is it not rather adults? You would say — they are already warned! Rather, it comes only to warn adults about the resting of minors. And this is what we learned (Shabbat 121): a minor who comes to extinguish — we do not listen to him, because his resting is upon you."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:15.702065905Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}